## Architecture (app navigation)

Single-root screen stack in `App.tsx` — no expo-router.

| Screen | Component | Entry |
|--------|-----------|-------|
| `home` | `InstructionPage.tsx` | App launch |
| `game` | `AppContent` | New Game / Continue |
| `settings` | `SettingsPage.tsx` | Gear icon on home |
| `career` | `CareerPage.tsx` | Career badge on home, or Settings → 승진 현황 button |

