### Rank ladder (8 tiers)

| Rank | KO | Wins to promote |
|------|-----|-----------------|
| intern | 인턴 | 3 |
| staff | 사원 | 5 |
| assistant | 대리 | 7 |
| manager | 과장 | 10 |
| deputy | 차장 | 5 |
| director | 부장 | 7 |
| executive | 전무 | 5 |
| ceo | 사장 | — (top rank) |

### What counts as 1 win

**1승 = Level 5 full clear** (`finishRun(..., true)` / `isFullRunComplete`).

| Event | Career credit |
|-------|---------------|
| Level 5 last stage cleared | **+1 win** toward next rank |
| Levels 1–4 last stage cleared | Auto-advance only — **no** career credit |
| Stage game over (moves / timer) | Loss — count **unchanged**, rank **unchanged** |
| Career mode off | No storage updates |

**Wiring:** `useCandyBreak({ onRunResult })` → `CareerProvider.recordRunResult` → `applyRunResult`. Promotion triggers `PromotionOverlay` in `AppRoot`.

