### Record card (step 10)

**Run end:** `finishRun(finalScore, didWin)` — single entry point when a **run** ends (not mid-stage advance). Sets `gameOver`, loads leaderboard async, sets `isNewRunRecord` via `qualifiesForLeaderboardScore`. While loading, `isLeaderboardPending` suppresses overlays. When career mode on, also calls `onRunResult` (+1 win on `didWin`, loss otherwise).

**When `finishRun` fires:**

| Trigger | `didWin` |
|---------|----------|
| Level 5 last stage cleared (`isFullRunComplete`) | `true` |
| Moves exhausted (non–timer-attack, goal not met) | `false` |
| Timer hits 0 (`timer-attack`) | `false` |

**Not** on levels 1–4 stage clears (auto-advance) or mid-run app quit (`savedGame` resume only).

**Top-10 gate (`isNewRunRecord`):**
- `< 10` leaderboard entries → score > 0 qualifies
- 10 entries → score must be **strictly above** 10th-place score (ties with 10th do not qualify)
- Replaces prior gate: level-5 full win + beat run-start `bestScore`

| Run end | `isNewRunRecord` | UI |
|---------|------------------|-----|
| Win or lose | `true` (top-10 qualified) | `RecordCardOverlay` at `SafeAreaView` root (`zIndex` 1000) |
| Win | `false` | Full-screen tap overlay: `gameOver.titleWin` + `gameOver.win` → `restartFromLevelOne()` |
| Lose | `false` | `gameOver.titleLose` + mode-specific body; tap → `restart()` (retry stage) |

**`RecordCardOverlay.tsx`:** `recordCard.title`, final score, 3-letter initials, **Save** → `saveLeaderboardEntry` + rank, **Play Again** → `restartFromLevelOne()` (save optional). No quit / back-to-intro button.

**`restartFromLevelOne()`:** clear `savedGame`, reset score to 0, fresh run from level 1 stage 0 (`createFreshRunState`), clear `won` / `gameOver` / `isNewRunRecord` / `isLeaderboardPending`. Does **not** return to intro.

**Sequence:** stage goal met → stars (~1.5s) → next stage/level **or** `finishRun`; on run end → record card **or** win/lose overlay; fireworks on any full win (`won && gameOver`).

**Quit without Save:** `savedGame` already cleared at `gameOver`; leaderboard entry not written unless **Save** tapped; `bestScore` may still reflect mid-run HUD bumps.

**i18n:** `recordCard.*` (card UI); `gameOver.titleWin` + `gameOver.win` (non–top-10 full win only)

**Deferred:** “View board” from record card → `LeaderboardView` with `highlightRank`; HUD `bestScore` vs `leaderboard[0]` unification; back-to-intro from record card.

**Files:** `RecordCardOverlay.tsx`, `App.tsx`, `useCandyBreak.ts`, `game.ts` (`isFullRunComplete`, `MAX_LEVEL`), `utils/leaderboard.ts`, `i18n/*`

